window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>One will break her. One will save her.</i></b><br> <br> <b>Her Shadow</b><br> <br> He dared to take her from me.<br> <br> And I have to get her back before it’s too late.<br> <br> I will unleash the monster within. I’ll paint the walls red and burn the world down to reach her, no matter what it costs—even if she can’t love what I’ve become.<br> <br> In the end, I’ll become her nightmare to reclaim what's <i>mine</i>.<br> <br> <b>Her Warden</b><br> <br> I might possess her body, but he’s stolen her heart.<br> <br> She’ll try to escape her pretty little cage, but she doesn’t understand—I’ve waited too long, planned too deeply, to ever let her go.<br> <br> I will control her. Own her. Break her.<br> <br> And in the end, she will be <i>mine.</i></p> <p><b><i>Catching Pretty contains a morally gray kidnapper who falls first and harder and is willing to do whatever twisted thing it takes to have and save her. Please check inside the book for full TWs. Catching Pretty is Book 2 of the Lovely Broken Doll trilogy and ends with one hecking heck of a cliffhanger. Hunting Pretty must be listened to first. The trilogy is now complete.</i></b></p>"; 
